{"id":"e3QfvB_iCHU","title":"Theme 17. At the table - Do you want some more? | ESL Song & Story - Learning English for Kids","speaker":"English Singsing","channel":"Kids","level":"A1","duration":"04:32","views":"1.1M","emoji":"👶","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #a1c4fd, #c2e9fb)","zh":"【English Singsing】主題 17. 在餐桌上 - 你還想要更多嗎？ | ESL 歌曲與故事 - 兒童英語學習（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e3QfvB_iCHU","cues":[{"start":3.3,"duration":13.98,"text":"Theme 17. At the table That smells good.","en":"Theme 17. At the table That smells good.","zh":"主題 17. 餐桌上 聞起來很香。"},{"start":18.46,"duration":3.2,"text":"Help yourself, Mike, Sally.","en":"Help yourself, Mike, Sally.","zh":"救救自己吧，麥克，莎莉。"},{"start":22.42,"duration":1.22,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":26.52,"duration":2.12,"text":"Sally, watch me.","en":"Sally, watch me.","zh":"莎莉，看著我。"},{"start":31.72,"duration":1.58,"text":"Thanks for your help.","en":"Thanks for your help.","zh":"感謝您的協助。"},{"start":35.22,"duration":1.7,"text":"It's not easy.","en":"It's not easy.","zh":"這並不容易。"},{"start":37.86,"duration":1.78,"text":"May I have a fork?","en":"May I have a fork?","zh":"我可以要一把叉子嗎？"},{"start":40.46,"duration":1.5,"text":"Yes, you may.","en":"Yes, you may.","zh":"是的，你可以。"},{"start":49.92,"duration":2.22,"text":"This soup is really good.","en":"This soup is really good.","zh":"這湯確實好喝。"},{"start":53.68,"duration":1.78,"text":"May I have some more?","en":"May I have some more?","zh":"我可以再要一些嗎？"},{"start":56.28,"duration":3.66,"text":"Sure. Do you want some more, Sally?","en":"Sure. Do you want some more, Sally?","zh":"當然。你還想要更多嗎，莎莉？"},{"start":60.7,"duration":2.82,"text":"No, thank you. I'm full.","en":"No, thank you. I'm full.","zh":"不，謝謝。我吃飽了。"},{"start":67.08,"duration":2.06,"text":"I had a good time.","en":"I had a good time.","zh":"我玩得很開心。"},{"start":69.4,"duration":2.12,"text":"Thanks for a great evening.","en":"Thanks for a great evening.","zh":"感謝您度過了一個美好的夜晚。"},{"start":72.4,"duration":1.34,"text":"My pleasure.","en":"My pleasure.","zh":"我的榮幸。"},{"start":74.38,"duration":1.98,"text":"May I visit you again?","en":"May I visit you again?","zh":"我可以再次拜訪您嗎？"},{"start":76.78,"duration":1.38,"text":"Of course.","en":"Of course.","zh":"當然。"},{"start":91.84,"duration":3.56,"text":"Help yourself. Help yourself.","en":"Help yourself. Help yourself.","zh":"幫助自己。幫助自己。"},{"start":95.4,"duration":3.38,"text":"Thank you. Oh, It's good!","en":"Thank you. Oh, It's good!","zh":"謝謝。哦，很好！"},{"start":99.04,"duration":2.86,"text":"Do you want some more?","en":"Do you want some more?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎？"},{"start":102.44,"duration":3.4,"text":"Yes, please. Thanks.","en":"Yes, please. Thanks.","zh":"是的，請。謝謝。"},{"start":106.02,"duration":1.74,"text":"Do you want some more?","en":"Do you want some more?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎？"},{"start":107.76,"duration":3.38,"text":"No, thanks. I'm full.","en":"No, thanks. I'm full.","zh":"不，謝謝。我吃飽了。"},{"start":126.0,"duration":3.3,"text":"Help yourself. Help yourself. Help yourself.","en":"Help yourself. Help yourself. Help yourself.","zh":"幫助自己。幫助自己。幫助自己。"},{"start":129.84,"duration":2.12,"text":"Thank you. Thank you.","en":"Thank you. Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。謝謝。"},{"start":131.96,"duration":1.66,"text":"Oh, it's great!","en":"Oh, it's great!","zh":"噢，太棒了！"},{"start":133.72,"duration":2.0,"text":"Do you want some more?","en":"Do you want some more?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎？"},{"start":135.72,"duration":1.88,"text":"Do you want some more?","en":"Do you want some more?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎？"},{"start":137.6,"duration":2.48,"text":"Yes, please. Yes, please.","en":"Yes, please. Yes, please.","zh":"是的，請。是的，請。"},{"start":141.6,"duration":1.92,"text":"Do you want some more, Jenny?","en":"Do you want some more, Jenny?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎，珍妮？"},{"start":143.52,"duration":1.96,"text":"Do you want some more, Jenny?","en":"Do you want some more, Jenny?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎，珍妮？"},{"start":145.48,"duration":2.02,"text":"No, thanks. No, thanks.","en":"No, thanks. No, thanks.","zh":"不，謝謝。不，謝謝。"},{"start":147.5,"duration":1.52,"text":"I'm full.","en":"I'm full.","zh":"我吃飽了。"},{"start":167.18,"duration":2.64,"text":"Hello, how are you?","en":"Hello, how are you?","zh":"你好嗎？"},{"start":169.88,"duration":2.14,"text":"I’m good. Thanks.","en":"I’m good. Thanks.","zh":"我很好。謝謝。"},{"start":173.88,"duration":1.54,"text":"Can I come in?","en":"Can I come in?","zh":"我可以進來嗎？"},{"start":175.86,"duration":1.18,"text":"Sure.","en":"Sure.","zh":"當然。"},{"start":179.76,"duration":2.04,"text":"Do you like apples?","en":"Do you like apples?","zh":"你喜歡蘋果嗎？"},{"start":182.52,"duration":2.72,"text":"Yes, I like apples.","en":"Yes, I like apples.","zh":"是的，我喜歡蘋果。"},{"start":186.76,"duration":1.64,"text":"Help yourself.","en":"Help yourself.","zh":"幫助自己。"},{"start":188.62,"duration":1.34,"text":"Thanks.","en":"Thanks.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":194.32,"duration":2.14,"text":"Do you want some more?","en":"Do you want some more?","zh":"你還想要更多嗎？"},{"start":196.52,"duration":1.24,"text":"No, thanks.","en":"No, thanks.","zh":"不，謝謝。"},{"start":206.02,"duration":1.3,"text":"Are you okay?","en":"Are you okay?","zh":"你還好嗎？"},{"start":207.34,"duration":2.32,"text":"I’m okay. Thank you.","en":"I’m okay. Thank you.","zh":"我沒事。謝謝。"},{"start":209.66,"duration":2.16,"text":"I’m so happy.","en":"I’m so happy.","zh":"我太高興了。"},{"start":232.18,"duration":1.96,"text":"Where are you, Klin?","en":"Where are you, Klin?","zh":"克林，你在哪裡？"},{"start":234.14,"duration":1.36,"text":"Where are you?","en":"Where are you?","zh":"你在哪裡？"},{"start":235.68,"duration":0.96,"text":"Here!","en":"Here!","zh":"這裡！"},{"start":239.36,"duration":1.84,"text":"Do you like chicken?","en":"Do you like chicken?","zh":"你喜歡雞肉嗎？"},{"start":242.98,"duration":1.02,"text":"Yes.","en":"Yes.","zh":"是的。"},{"start":244.28,"duration":1.44,"text":"Help your self.","en":"Help your self.","zh":"幫助你自己。"},{"start":245.88,"duration":1.6,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":251.72,"duration":2.78,"text":"Oh, It's great!","en":"Oh, It's great!","zh":"哦，太棒了！"},{"start":257.74,"duration":2.08,"text":"Do you want some more chicken?","en":"Do you want some more chicken?","zh":"你還想要一些雞肉嗎？"},{"start":259.82,"duration":3.06,"text":"Yes, please. Thank you.","en":"Yes, please. Thank you.","zh":"是的，請。謝謝。"}],"words":[]}